{"id":"45a8b0be7d3a8fde","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-shelling.md","title":"Shelling of an ordered DNF","display":"df-shelling — Shelling of an ordered DNF","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-shelling","aliases":["27-df-shelling"],"display":"df-shelling — Shelling of an ordered DNF","depends_on":["[[27-df-dnf]]","[[27-df-term]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-shelling"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-shelling</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-shelling — Shelling of an ordered DNF"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e065076d6b51508e\" href=\"?note=e065076d6b51508e\" title=\"27-df-term\">27-df-term</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf T:[m]\\to\\mathrm{Term}_n\">\\(\\mathbf T:[m]\\to\\mathrm{Term}_n\\)</span> is injective; write <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_j=\\mathbf T(j)\">\\(T_j=\\mathbf T(j)\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Shelling}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Shelling}_n\\)</span> is the predicate to be defined on finite injective sequences in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_n\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Shelling}_n(\\mathbf T)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\forall j\\in[m]\\;\\exists U\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(U(a)=T_j(a)\\prod_{1\\le i&lt;j}(1-T_i(a))\\right),\\qquad\\prod\\varnothing=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Shelling}_n(\\mathbf T)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\forall j\\in[m]\\;\\exists U\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(U(a)=T_j(a)\\prod_{1\\le i&lt;j}(1-T_i(a))\\right),\\qquad\\prod\\varnothing=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §7.2.1, Definition 7.1，印刷页 330，PDF 第 354 页（从 1 计数）。 已把旧版本的 simplicial-facet 条件改为原书语义：每个新增真点块恰是一个非零 elementary conjunction。Term_n 排除零项，故不能把空新增块当成 shelling。顺序现在作为枚举序列的显式参数，不再假定集合 D 自带编号。空 DNF 采用真空 shelling 的局部延伸。 原书 Definition 7.1 的印刷公式末项写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_k\">\\(C_k\\)</span>，没有随排列写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_{\\pi(k)}\">\\(C_{\\pi(k)}\\)</span>；按该定义的排列语境及 Example 7.2，本文用有序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_j\">\\(T_j\\)</span> 消除这个指标排印差异。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"e065076d6b51508e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$; $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$, as in [[27-df-boolfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DNF}_n$ and $\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ are as in [[27-df-dnf]].","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf T:[m]\\to\\mathrm{Term}_n","display":false},{"tex":"T_j=\\mathbf T(j)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Shelling}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Shelling}_n(\\mathbf T)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\forall j\\in[m]\\;\\exists U\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(U(a)=T_j(a)\\prod_{1\\le i<j}(1-T_i(a))\\right),\\qquad\\prod\\varnothing=1.","display":true},{"tex":"C_k","display":false},{"tex":"C_{\\pi(k)}","display":false},{"tex":"T_j","display":false}],"bytes":1642,"backlinks":[{"id":"71326b2cdccfdfb4","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Shelling}_n$ is defined in [[27-df-shelling]]."},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-339","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-shelling|df-shelling — Shelling of an ordered DNF]]"},{"id":"9bf4e8f79497e515","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$m\\in\\mathbb N$。$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\mathbf A:[m]\\to\\mathcal P([n])$ 单射，$A_k=\\mathbf A(k)$；$C_k,\\mathrm{Sh}_{\\mathbf A},U_k$ 见 [[27-df-shellshadow]]。$\\mathbf C$ 为下式构造的项序列；$\\mathrm{Shelling}_n$ 见 [[27-df-shelling]]。"},{"id":"67918b634d06af0a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$n,m\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\mathbf e:[m]\\to\\{e\\subseteq[n]:|e|=2\\}$ 单射；$E_k$ 与 $\\mathbf C$ 为下式构造的前缀边族与项序列。$\\mathrm{Shelling}_n$ 见 [[27-df-shelling]]。"},{"id":"087f6cd4ae08e7d5","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$m\\in\\mathbb N$, $\\mathbf T:[m]\\to\\mathrm{Term}_n$ is injective, $T_j=\\mathbf T(j)$, and $\\mathrm{Shelling}_n(\\mathbf T)$ holds as in [[27-df-shelling]]."}],"outgoing":["0b618255959ff4bc","e065076d6b51508e","5d10aed668d85817"]}